  "title": "Don’t Let Apple’s Siri AI Push Your Bank Behind The Glass",
  "summary": "Apple’s new Siri AI is one of the biggest threats to the bank-customer relationship since mobile banking, and most banks are about to underestimate it. Siri AI inserts itself not into the payment, as Apple Pay did, but into the relationship, where trust, growth, and primacy are won or lost. Answering a customer’s money question […]",
